{"title": "concat_unique on/off 混类型对比", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "# 默认 concat_unique on，css+js 混合："},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sw \"%{http_code}\" localhost/css/??style1.css,app2.js"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "400"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "# concat_unique off; 后同一请求："},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost/css/??style1.css,app2.js"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "body { color: red; }"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "console.log(\"js1\");"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "跨目录 ../ 始终 400，unique off 也不放行"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测：Alpine 容器自编译 nginx 1.28.0"}
]}
